14
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,068
Whose is that?

15
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:32,968
She glances upstairs.

16
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:34,281
The witness's.

17
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,855
A man steps onto the stairs.

18
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:38,405
In the mirror,

19
